{
  "$schema": "https://mintlify.com/docs.json",
  "theme": "mint",
  "name": "Akapulu Labs",
  "variables": {
    "app-url": "https://akapulu.com",
    "api-base-url": "https://akapulu.com/api"
  },
  "description": "Akapulu Labs is an AI research lab building live conversational avatars.",
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "Akapulu Labs builds live AI avatars on real-time calls. Two shapes: (1) a hosted link \u2014 public page Akapulu Labs hosts; open URL, Start Call; page never sees the API key; (2) your voice pipeline (speech-to-speech or any stack that produces assistant audio) plus Akapulu Labs avatar video in a Daily room you create. Calls use conversation minutes (akapulu.com/pricing). For agent onboarding (skills, MCP, account, which path to take), follow https://docs.akapulu.com/agent-setup.md.",
      "Hosted links: create in the dashboard or Bearer CRUD on /api/hosted-links/ (GET/POST/DELETE collection; GET/PUT/DELETE by id). Create body is exactly label, avatar_id, system_prompt, show_ai_label. Response includes url and token.",
      "Plugin path: Akapulu Labs uses Daily. They create the room and three meeting tokens (browser, voice bot, Akapulu Labs worker). POST /api/live-sessions/ with avatar_id, show_ai_label, room_url, avatar_token starts the Akapulu Labs worker and returns session_id. AkapuluAvatar (pipecat-akapulu) runs inside the voice bot after assistant audio and forwards that audio to the worker; voice-bot audio/video out stay off. Public example akapulu-examples uses OpenAI Live (gpt-live-1).",
      "Every avatar frame has an invisible mark; verify with POST /api/video-marks/ then POST /api/video-marks/<id>/read/. API errors include error_code \u2014 branch on that field, not the English string."
    ]
  },
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/",
      "destination": "/quickstart"
    },
    {
      "source": "/blog",
      "destination": "https://blog.akapulu.com"
    },
    {
      "source": "/blog/welcome-to-the-akapulu-blog",
      "destination": "https://blog.akapulu.com/what-is-akapulu-labs"
    },
    {
      "source": "/blog/what-is-akapulu",
      "destination": "https://blog.akapulu.com/what-is-akapulu-labs"
    },
    {
      "source": "/blog/what-is-akapulu/what-is-akapulu",
      "destination": "https://blog.akapulu.com/what-is-akapulu-labs"
    }
  ],
